	{"Opening the launcher", "打开启动器"},
	{"In place of LG Home", "代替 LG Home"},
	{"When the launcher takes LG Home's place, the TV itself opens it for the Home button, Back out of the last app and waking up. It is set up from a computer with tools/takeover.sh (see the README); \"takeover.sh disable\" gives LG Home back.", "当启动器取代 LG Home 的位置时，电视会在按主页键、退出最后一个应用和唤醒时自动打开它。需要在电脑上用 tools/takeover.sh 设置（见 README）；“takeover.sh disable”可恢复 LG Home。"},
	{"Background helper", "后台助手"},
	{"The other way, for when the launcher is not in LG Home's place: a small program on the TV watches for LG Home and opens the launcher instead, from the moment the TV starts. LG Home can show for a moment first.", "另一种方式，适用于启动器不在 LG Home 位置的情况：电视上的一个小程序会监视 LG Home，并从电视启动起就改为打开启动器。LG Home 可能会先短暂出现。"},
